{"file_path":"/Users/arsenvlasov/Documents/WorkFolder/harness-demo-runs/set-3/run-2/suite-a/tests/TC-06-invalid-and-expired-coupon.spec.ts","content":"// TC-06: Invalid coupon and expired coupon (test-cases/TC-06-invalid-and-expired-coupon.md)
